+            $sw.Elapsed.TotalSeconds | Should BeLessThan 20
+
+            Clear-XlsOrphans | Out-Null
+        }
+
+        It 'does not start the timeoutSec countdown when an unrelated ready file/marker appears first (round 2 review blocking (a))' {
